        "TileImage": "$($repository 90aaf463-cf27-4e46-8088-b91650e9e861).Image",
        "Description": "Zana &quot;The Vulture&quot; Kazeem is having a very bad day. People keep getting in his way and annoying him. Time for you to take petty revenge in his place.\r\rDressed as Kazeem, eliminate the following:\r\r- Bystander Sandy Jernigan, for telling him not to smoke\r- Assistant Kelly To, for insisting a professional assassin be frisked\r- Guard Michael Majumdar, for doing the same\r- Sheikh Omar Al-Ghazali, for wasting his time\r\rGood luck, 47.",
